* cwht receiver front-end band-pass filter, sections 2+3 resonators, design ripple bandwidth 5 MHz, coil Q stepped 
* Generated by hardware/sim/rx-frontend/make_decks.py (do not edit by hand). LTspice 26.0.2 via tools/ltspice-batch.sh.
* Topology: shunt parallel-LC resonators, top-C coupling, series-C end coupling (bpf_design.py).
* Resonator L 56 nH; coil Q QU (stepped or fixed); capacitor Q 500 (estimate); ground via 5nH per resonator.

.param QC=500 LVIA=5n
.step param QU list 100 120 150 200
V1 s1 0 AC 2
R1s s1 i1 50
R1l o1 0 50
* b1: 2-resonator top-C coupled, design BW 5.00 MHz, ripple 0.1 dB, L 56 nH
Cb1sin i1 b1r1 4.4243p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*4.424272e-12*QC)}
Lb11 b1r1 b1g1 56.0000n Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb1sh1 b1r1 b1g1 15.9709p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.597091e-11*QC)}
Lb1v1 b1g1 0 {LVIA}
Cb1k1 b1r1 b1r2 1.0038p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.003815e-12*QC)}
Lb12 b1r2 b1g2 56.0000n Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb1sh2 b1r2 b1g2 15.9709p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.597091e-11*QC)}
Lb1v2 b1g2 0 {LVIA}
Cb1sout b1r2 o1 4.4243p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*4.424272e-12*QC)}
V2 s2 0 AC 2
R2s s2 i2 50
R2l o2 0 50
* b2: 3-resonator top-C coupled, design BW 5.00 MHz, ripple 0.1 dB, L 56 nH
Cb2sin i2 b2r1 3.9847p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*3.984677e-12*QC)}
Lb21 b2r1 b2g1 56.0000n Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb2sh1 b2r1 b2g1 16.7000p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.669999e-11*QC)}
Lb2v1 b2g1 0 {LVIA}
Cb2k1 b2r1 b2r2 0.6682p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*6.681530e-13*QC)}
Lb22 b2r2 b2g2 56.0000n Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb2sh2 b2r2 b2g2 19.8877p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.988773e-11*QC)}
Lb2v2 b2g2 0 {LVIA}
Cb2k2 b2r2 b2r3 0.6682p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*6.681530e-13*QC)}
Lb23 b2r3 b2g3 56.0000n Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb2sh3 b2r3 b2g3 16.7000p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.669999e-11*QC)}
Lb2v3 b2g3 0 {LVIA}
Cb2sout b2r3 o2 3.9847p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*3.984677e-12*QC)}
.ac dec 2000 1Meg 1G
.save V(o1) V(o2)
.options plotwinsize=0 numdgt=15
.end
